      "writtenOn": "2020-12-15T00:37:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That build error won\u0027t be very informative, but perhaps the \"jars/are/invalid\" path provides enough of a hint. Ideally java_import would support this case with a flag and an empty jars array, but I suppose you have good reason to not take that route?",
      "range": {
