      "writtenOn": "2020-12-15T00:37:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a bit of a hacky way to create an empty file, and I\u0027m somewhat wary of using absolute paths. Suggestion: change this to return an OptionalPath, and add something like SnapshotBuilder.CreateEmptyInSnapshot that uses android.Touch to create the file.",
      "range": {
